  id: Secret_Lore
  title: ???
  fullText: 'I found this once before...


    This cave is strange

    It is filled
    with bats and strange noises


    The Old Lady keeps telling me

    The Bats
    and Caves


    Are there more secrets between the islands?


    Maybe I should
    try and look for more caves

    But I keep going around in circles


    The
    bats, the caves

    They made me crazy


    Crazy?, I was crazy once

    The
    bats, the caves

    They made me crazy...

    Crazy?...'
